# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#  Copy to .env.local and fill in what you need. Nothing here is required:
#  with an empty file the app runs on an embedded Postgres with mock providers.
#  Check what is actually configured at /preflight.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# ── Database ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Leave unset for local work: the app runs PGlite (Postgres compiled to WASM,
# with pgvector) against ./.pglite and migrates itself on first connect.
# Set it to a Neon connection string for deployment — serverless needs a real
# database, and the embedded one is per-process.
# DATABASE_URL=postgresql://user:pass@ep-xxx.region.aws.neon.tech/neondb?sslmode=require
# Where the embedded database keeps its files. `memory://` keeps it in RAM.
# PGLITE_DIR=.pglite

# ── Model providers ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# All optional. With none set, LLM_MODE falls back to `mock` and the whole app
# (including the test suite and the eval runner) still works.
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-...
# GEMINI_API_KEY=...
# GROQ_API_KEY=gsk_...

# ── Model routing ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# mock   — never calls a model; deterministic, offline, demo-safe
# cached — serves from the response cache, calls a model on a miss
# live   — calls a model (the default as soon as any key above is set)
# LLM_MODE=live
# The chain, tried in order. Model ids are never hard-coded in the source.
# LLM_PRIMARY=claude-sonnet-5
# LLM_FALLBACKS=claude-haiku-4-5-20251001,gemini-2.5-flash,llama-3.3-70b-versatile
# Response cache: `off` disables reads and writes. Keep it on to rehearse a demo.
# LLM_CACHE=on
# Per-session ceilings, so a tool loop cannot exhaust a free tier mid-demo. Sized for a
# whole conversation: a session is long-lived, and a ceiling sized for one turn makes every
# later turn fall back silently. agent.maxSteps in idea.config.ts bounds a single turn.
# LLM_MAX_CALLS_PER_SESSION=120
# LLM_MAX_TOOL_STEPS=60
# LLM_MAX_TOKENS_PER_SESSION=500000
# An OpenAI-compatible endpoint other than Groq (Together, Fireworks, OpenRouter…).
# GROQ_BASE_URL=https://api.groq.com/openai/v1

# ── Embeddings ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Unset means deterministic local embeddings: memory search works with no key.
# EMBED_PROVIDER=voyage
# VOYAGE_API_KEY=pa-...
# EMBED_PROVIDER=openai
# OPENAI_API_KEY=sk-...
# EMBED_MODEL=voyage-3-lite

# ── Tools ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# web_search uses Tavily when this is set, and clearly-labelled mock results otherwise.
# TAVILY_API_KEY=tvly-...
# ml_predict posts to this endpoint; mocked when unset.
# ML_ENDPOINT=https://your-model.example.com/predict
# ML_API_KEY=...

# ── Connectors (the partner-tool integration slot) ──────────────────────────
# Each is enabled only when its keys are present. Approvals fall back to the
# local outbox otherwise, so the demo works with none of these.
# GITHUB_TOKEN=ghp_...
# GITHUB_REPO=owner/name
# NOTION_TOKEN=secret_...
# NOTION_DATABASE_ID=...
# RESEND_API_KEY=re_...
# RESEND_FROM=you@yourdomain.com
# SLACK_WEBHOOK_URL=https://hooks.slack.com/services/...

# ── Auth (optional) ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# The app works signed out; a demo should not open with a login wall. Set these
# only if the idea needs accounts. With a real DATABASE_URL sessions are stored
# in Postgres; on the embedded database they are JWTs.
# AUTH_SECRET=generate-with-openssl-rand-base64-32
# AUTH_GOOGLE_ID=...
# AUTH_GOOGLE_SECRET=...
# Deployed host only. Keep commented locally: an empty value counts as set and
# switches host trust off.
# AUTH_URL=https://your-app.vercel.app
# Only for `npm start` on localhost; Vercel provides it in production.
# AUTH_TRUST_HOST=true

# ── Scheduler ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Without this, /api/cron is unauthenticated. Fine locally; set it before deploying.
# CRON_SECRET=generate-with-openssl-rand-base64-32

# ── Hero 3D scene (optional) ────────────────────────────────────────────────
# The hero has a slot for a Spline scene and ships without one — the original's
# artwork belonged to another project. Unset, nothing is fetched and the hero
# uses its animated orb instead. To add one: export from Spline, drop the file in
# public/, and point this at it.
# NEXT_PUBLIC_HERO_SCENE_URL=/hero-scene.splinecode
# Only if you vendor the runtime's wasm modules rather than using Spline's CDN.
# NEXT_PUBLIC_HERO_SCENE_WASM_PATH=/spline

# ── Site ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Used for absolute URLs in metadata and the OG image.
# NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL=https://your-app.vercel.app
